meta {
  name: Change a consent
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

put {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/privacy/consents
  body: json
}

body:json {
  {
    "type": "marketing",
    "granted": false
  }
}

docs {
  Only `marketing` is withdrawable. Withdrawing the terms or the privacy notice
  is not a consent change — it is a request to close the account — so posting
  either is a validation failure rather than a silently ignored field.

  Every change is a new row in an append-only log. Nothing is ever edited.
}
